      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_179061e70a148451_1",
        "edit": "Fix malformed binary literals in the case branches: 3'b100 now assigns 8'b0001_0000 (was 8'b0001_000, which is 8 bits but wrong value 0x08) and 3'b111 now assigns 8'b1000_0000 (was 8'b100_0000, which is 7 bits and wrong value 0x40). This corrects the one-hot decoder outputs so a=3'b100 produces 0x10 and a=3'b111 produces 0x80.",
